    "decisionSummary": "Selected the 2026-08-22 dev-publish TeleScreen v0.0.17/v21 cut. It fixes a defect that made the app's advertised outbound capability unusable: a Grapple grant of ScreeningService could never complete, because Sandstorm calls AppPersistent.save() on a capability while fulfilling the PowerBox request and the cap handed over was a bare ScreeningService client with no such method. SessionContext.fulfillRequest failed with a nested 'unimplemented' and every consuming grain waited forever. The fulfil now hands over a client carrying BOTH AppPersistent and ScreeningService, the shape telescreen_subcap.go already used for the inside-install sub-cap, and MainView.restore gained a ScreeningService branch under its own objectId tag so a granted cap survives a restart. Also repairs the release-cohort guard, whose pkgdef appVersion regex was a hardcoded 20 while its failure message interpolated wantVersionNumber - it asserted the opposite of what it claimed. main is the same commit as dev-publish for this cut.",
