            "MUTATION CONTROL: a half-bumped sandstorm-pkgdef.capnp (appVersion left at 20) fails TestReleaseCohortAgrees by name; the full cohort passes",
            "version cohort advanced together: sandstorm-pkgdef.capnp, metadata.json, pyproject.toml, changelog.md, release_cohort_test.go constants",
